| MySQL Type   | Target Type                                         |
| ------------ | --------------------------------------------------- |
| TINYINT      | BYTE / SMALLINT / INTEGER depending on source usage |
| SMALLINT     | SMALLINT                                            |
| INT          | INT                                                 |
| BIGINT       | BIGINT                                              |
| DECIMAL(p,s) | DECIMAL(p,s)                                        |
| FLOAT        | FLOAT                                               |
| DOUBLE       | DOUBLE                                              |
| CHAR         | STRING                                              |
| VARCHAR      | STRING                                              |
| TEXT         | STRING                                              |
| DATE         | DATE                                                |
| DATETIME     | TIMESTAMP                                           |
| TIMESTAMP    | TIMESTAMP                                           |
| BINARY       | BINARY                                              |
| VARBINARY    | BINARY                                              |
